/kyanowo1107.github.io/20250824/the-start-of-all/","excerpt":"","text":"试着喝了奶茶店的新品，结果意外地好喝。试着掌握新的技能，为发掘新的事物而欣喜。试着踏足未曾到达的领域，遇见未知…… 许多尝试大多微不足道，甚至谈不上是什么“挑战”。失败了，无伤大雅；成功了，便是一份窃喜，像藏在口袋里的一颗糖。 或许，生活的趣味并不在于宏大的叙事，而正是这些细碎的、闪着微光的“我试试”。 所以，这个博客也是我的又一个“小小尝试”。 希望它能留下一些美好的痕迹。 ヾ(@^▽^@)ノ","categories":[{"name":"日常/杂谈","slug":"日常-杂谈","permalink":"https://kyanowo1107.github.io/categories/%E6%97%A5%E5%B8%B8-%E6%9D%82%E8%B0%88/"}],"tags":[{"name":"杂谈","slug":"杂谈","permalink":"https://kyanowo1107.github.io/tags/%E6%9D%82%E8%B0%88/"}],"author":"Kyan"}],"categories":[{"name":"日常/杂谈","slug":"日常-杂谈","permalink":"https://kyanowo1107.github.io/categories/%E6%97%A5%E5%B8%B8-%E6%9D%82%E8%B0%88/"},{"name":"新年快乐","slug":"新年快乐","permalink":"https://kyanowo1107.github.io/categories/%E6%96%B0%E5%B9%B4%E5%BF%AB%E4%B9%90/"},{"name":"项目","slug":"项目","permalink":"https://kyanowo1107.github.io/categories/%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE/"},{"name":"学习","slug":"项目/学习","permalink":"https://kyanowo1107.github.io/categories/%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE/%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0/"}],"tags":[{"name":"日常","slug":"日常","permalink":"https://kyanowo1107.github.io/tags/%E6%97%A5%E5%B8%B8/"},{"name":"新年快乐","slug":"新年快乐","permalink":"https://kyanowo1107.github.io/tags/%E6%96%B0%E5%B9%B4%E5%BF%AB%E4%B9%90/"},{"name":"生日","slug":"生日","permalink":"https://kyanowo1107.github.io/tags/%E7%94%9F%E6%97%A5/"},{"name":"项目","slug":"项目","permalink":"https://kyanowo1107.github.io/tags/%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE/"},{"name":"学习","slug":"学习","permalink":"https://kyanowo1107.github.io/tags/%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0/"},{"name":"杂谈","slug":"杂谈","permalink":"https://kyanowo1107.github.io/tags/%E6%9D%82%E8%B0%88/"}]}